  "post_content": "<p>(62 fotos) Espadilla ha iniciado este viernes sus fiestas patronales, que se extender&aacute;n hasta el jueves 24 de agosto. Adem&aacute;s de reses de la ganader&iacute;a el Mijares, j&oacute;venes y</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/LosIndeseablesEspadilla.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>la pe&ntilde;a Los indeseables han patrocinado sendas vacas con</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/EmboladaVacaLosIndeseablesEspadilla.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>sus emboladas, una de ellas todav&iacute;a de d&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2441.jpg\" alt=\"img_2441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2445.jpg\" alt=\"img_2445\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2447.jpg\" alt=\"img_2447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2449.jpg\" alt=\"img_2449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2451.jpg\" alt=\"img_2451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2452.jpg\" alt=\"img_2452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivendres/img_2454.jpg\" alt=\"img_2454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espadilla17vaquesdivend